{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126184325287-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126191111\"/><p>消防到場把火救熄。（陳嘉順攝）</p><p>今午(26日)5時10分，旺角登打士街89-91號翠園大樓，一名姓劉(55歲)男工人燒焊切割喉管期間，懷疑火舌焫着棚架圍網引起火警，途人見狀報案。消防接報趕至開喉將火救熄，但男工燒傷手及小腿，需要送往廣華醫院治療。事件中約10人自行疏散，案件列作「火警」及「有人意外受傷」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.076975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:43:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:15.975545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:15.521537+00:00","content_hash":"2f954907ebd316792cd4ac9583436895ca5610350c59ddb3a626878a2bafd8e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.076975+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}